  Code and weights are CC BY-NC 4.0. Training labels are produced by this teacher, so models trained on them are for
  non-commercial research use only.
- SigLIP2 (Google) for structure judgement of ambiguous teacher masks.

Training data (not redistributed here): COCO train2017 images (Flickr licences) and COCO-panoptic / LVIS v1 annotations
(CC BY 4.0). The uHumans2 evaluation data is not used for training in any form.

